    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 28,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "It was about a hundred and five in the shade in this place. The women didn't wear any clothes at all to speak of - which was very intelligent of them. You lay in a hammock and three of them stood there fanning you. When I die, I hope to go to Accra."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 2,
        "line": 1231,
        "text": "Stand by, all newspapers! Flash continued! This first skirmish for the possession of the earth by the creatures from space was won by the daring leadership of Captain Patrick Henry. Noah once saved the world with an ark of wood."
      }
    },
